      "updated": 1790586891196,
      "created": 1790586891196,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Interval = [start, end)；end = start_sequence_no + chunk_count；成员满足 start ≤ sequence_no < end。\nN<K 时仅建 [0,N)；N≥K 逐起点建完整窗口，不补尾窗（如 [0,3)、[1,4)）。\n每个 VideoChunk 另有 [start_seconds, end_seconds) 时间边界。",
      "originalText": "Interval = [start, end)；end = start_sequence_no + chunk_count；成员满足 start ≤ sequence_no < end。\nN<K 时仅建 [0,N)；N≥K 逐起点建完整窗口，不补尾窗（如 [0,3)、[1,4)）。\n每个 VideoChunk 另有 [start_seconds, end_seconds) 时间边界。",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
