      "created": 1790586891196,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Video 汇总状态\nPENDING → PREPARING → PARSING → INDEXING → COMPLETE\nPARSING 时已有 Interval 可索引；INDEXING 表示必需解析已齐、仅余索引。\n准备 / Understanding / Refine 失败 → PARSING_FAILED；解析已齐但索引失败 → INDEXING_FAILED。",
      "originalText": "Video 汇总状态\nPENDING → PREPARING → PARSING → INDEXING → COMPLETE\nPARSING 时已有 Interval 可索引；INDEXING 表示必需解析已齐、仅余索引。\n准备 / Understanding / Refine 失败 → PARSING_FAILED；解析已齐但索引失败 → INDEXING_FAILED。",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "anivag-v2-d-retry",
