      "created": 1790586891196,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "按失败所在阶段恢复\nChunk FAILED → QUEUED\nInterval PARSING_FAILED → WAITING\nInterval INDEXING_FAILED → INDEXING\n同任务 ID / 配置 / 解析版本继续；\n主动重解析才新建解析任务。",
      "originalText": "按失败所在阶段恢复\nChunk FAILED → QUEUED\nInterval PARSING_FAILED → WAITING\nInterval INDEXING_FAILED → INDEXING\n同任务 ID / 配置 / 解析版本继续；\n主动重解析才新建解析任务。",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
